WEBVTT

00:12.590 --> 00:15.430
<b><i>My name is Eric Brooks.</i></b>

00:16.300 --> 00:19.310
<b><i>I'm a vampire hunter.</i></b>

00:22.690 --> 00:23.620
<b><i>Yeah...</i></b>

00:24.180 --> 00:26.770
<b><i>they're what goes bump in the night.</i></b>

00:55.590 --> 00:56.840
<b><i>I'm...</i></b>

00:56.840 --> 01:00.100
<b><i>half human and the other half
is one of them.</i></b>

01:01.640 --> 01:07.190
<b><i>As luck would have it, that means I can go out
in the sun, with the power of the Daywalker.</i></b>

01:19.280 --> 01:21.620
<b><i>I hunted them down and
cut them apart.</i></b>

01:22.830 --> 01:25.660
<b><i>It wasn't long before they feared
me, and started calling me...</i></b>

01:28.170 --> 01:29.420
<b><i>"Blade."</i></b>

02:34.570 --> 02:39.010
<i><b>Blade, the man</b></i>

02:44.030 --> 02:49.020
Yokohama

03:01.680 --> 03:03.300
<b><i>A red moon...</i></b>

03:04.560 --> 03:08.640
<b><i>I hear my mother died
on a night like this.</i></b>

03:14.320 --> 03:18.070
London

05:00.170 --> 05:05.130
<b><i>When I go out hunting, I remember something
the man who raised me said.</i></b>

05:05.930 --> 05:14.350
<b><i>"Be careful, because when you gaze into
an abyss, the abyss also gazes into you."</i></b>

05:22.860 --> 05:25.860
<b>Hey, baby, wait!</b>

05:29.330 --> 05:31.870
<b>Wait up!</b>

05:35.120 --> 05:38.920
<b>Where are you, pussycat?</b>

05:39.540 --> 05:43.300
<b>Don't hide, come on out...</b>

05:50.510 --> 05:52.720
<b>Found you.</b>

06:07.990 --> 06:08.990
<b>What the hell are you!?</b>

06:23.710 --> 06:24.840
<b>You gotta help me!</b>

06:24.840 --> 06:26.220
<b>This chick...</b>

06:26.220 --> 06:27.300
<b>she turned into a monster!</b>

06:27.300 --> 06:28.680
<b>Remain calm, sir.</b>

06:29.390 --> 06:31.070
<b>Everything's under control.</b>

06:55.200 --> 06:59.330
<b><i>You hear a lot of trash about crosses
and garlic hurting them...</i></b>

07:00.040 --> 07:01.830
<b><i>But, that's pure mythology.</i></b>

07:20.100 --> 07:23.770
<b><i>I prefer silver-edged blades...</i></b>

07:24.150 --> 07:26.980
<b><i>To cut them to pieces.</i></b>

07:28.490 --> 07:29.530
<b>You're Blade!</b>

07:34.990 --> 07:36.290
<b>Hey, man.</b>

07:37.580 --> 07:39.040
<b>Watch yourself at night.</b>

07:43.330 --> 07:44.290
<b>You.</b>

07:44.290 --> 07:45.170
<b>Wait!?</b>

07:52.890 --> 07:55.600
<b>Your kind uses that club
to feed, right?</b>

07:57.150 --> 08:00.870
<b>What's that sign above
the entrance mean?</b>

08:01.140 --> 08:03.360
<b>I dunno!</b>

08:03.360 --> 08:04.570
<b>Answer me.</b>

08:05.730 --> 08:09.720
<b>That's our organization,
Existence's, symbol!</b>

08:09.720 --> 08:11.320
<b>Existence?</b>

08:11.320 --> 08:12.490
<b>What's that supposed to be?</b>

08:12.490 --> 08:13.320
<b>Well...</b>

08:13.320 --> 08:16.660
<b>We're trying to become
the power players in Asia...</b>

08:17.080 --> 08:20.830
<b>You know about a vampire
with four fangs?</b>

08:20.830 --> 08:21.620
<b>No!</b>

08:22.120 --> 08:23.330
<b>Never heard of him!</b>

08:24.710 --> 08:27.000
<b>It's the truth!</b>

08:39.470 --> 08:41.850
<b>Damn, he scared me.</b>

08:41.850 --> 08:45.480
<b>He'll pay for this once
the boss gets here.</b>

08:45.480 --> 08:47.540
<b>Your boss is in town, huh?</b>

08:51.070 --> 08:52.720
<b>I better pay him a visit.</b>

09:00.830 --> 09:03.290
<b>We've been waiting for you, sir.</b>

09:03.290 --> 09:05.260
<b>Welcome to Feed.</b>

09:14.930 --> 09:15.820
<b>Makoto, </b>

09:16.510 --> 09:18.000
<b>are you ready?</b>

09:19.370 --> 09:20.330
<b>Okay.</b>

09:21.060 --> 09:22.890
<b>I'm heading in.</b>

09:22.890 --> 09:23.930
<b>Alright.</b>

09:23.930 --> 09:25.520
<b>We'll meet up later.</b>

09:27.060 --> 09:27.980
<b>Be careful.</b>

09:28.840 --> 09:30.020
<b>Got it.</b>

10:13.830 --> 10:16.420
<b>Welcome to Feed, miss.</b>

10:17.360 --> 10:20.490
<b>I'm the owner, Radu.</b>

10:20.490 --> 10:21.330
<b>Good evening.</b>

10:22.080 --> 10:24.330
<b>Good evening, Radu.</b>

10:24.330 --> 10:26.310
<b>This is a great place you have.</b>

10:26.750 --> 10:28.620
<b>Thank you so much.</b>

10:28.620 --> 10:35.300
<b>Having a vision of beauty like yourself appreciate
it is the finest compliment I can imagine.</b>

10:35.300 --> 10:37.320
<b>Oh, you flatterer.</b>

10:38.660 --> 10:43.390
<b>Why don't we share a drink,
and get to know each other better?</b>

10:45.120 --> 10:46.580
<b>I'd love to.</b>

10:56.430 --> 10:59.250
<b>May I ask your name?</b>

10:59.830 --> 11:00.880
<b>It's Makoto.</b>

11:01.110 --> 11:03.200
<b>Makoto...</b>

11:03.200 --> 11:05.330
<b>it sounds exquisite.</b>

11:06.290 --> 11:07.450
<b>Thank you.</b>

11:17.130 --> 11:18.050
<b>Huh?</b>

11:18.800 --> 11:20.010
<b>What's the matter?</b>

11:21.610 --> 11:23.570
<b>I smell something...</b>

11:24.430 --> 11:26.440
<b>Oh, this?</b>

11:27.610 --> 11:32.800
<b>It's a cologne from my homeland,
Romania...</b>

11:35.650 --> 11:37.700
<b>It stinks.</b>

11:38.740 --> 11:40.490
<b>Makoto?</b>

11:40.490 --> 11:43.090
<b>It doesn't matter how much
cologne you splash on...</b>

11:43.950 --> 11:47.450
<b>You reek like a wild animal.</b>

12:00.470 --> 12:01.760
<b>Who the hell are you!?</b>

12:10.140 --> 12:11.690
<b>A vampire hunter!</b>

12:33.250 --> 12:34.190
<b>Get out of here, hurry!</b>

12:38.590 --> 12:40.130
<b>Quit standing around!</b>

12:51.430 --> 12:52.020
<b>Makoto!</b>

12:52.020 --> 12:53.190
<b>You alright!?</b>

12:53.190 --> 12:54.390
<b>Oh, I'm great!</b>

13:05.240 --> 13:08.030
<b>You think you can get away
with this insult!?</b>

13:21.340 --> 13:23.260
<b>What the hell is he,
a werewolf!?</b>

13:34.270 --> 13:35.190
<b>Shit!</b>

13:35.190 --> 13:36.500
<b>The silver bullets aren't working!</b>

13:36.690 --> 13:37.190
<b>Dad!</b>

13:38.530 --> 13:40.210
<b>Over here, hairball!</b>

13:49.370 --> 13:51.200
<b>What a racket...</b>

14:39.570 --> 14:41.060
<b>Who the hell are you!?</b>

14:45.510 --> 14:46.650
<b>I've got this.</b>

14:46.920 --> 14:49.260
<b>Stay out of our way!</b>

14:49.260 --> 14:50.180
<b>Get moving.</b>

14:50.180 --> 14:50.800
<b>Right.</b>

14:50.800 --> 14:52.100
<b>Take care of it!</b>

14:52.100 --> 14:53.430
<b>Dad!?</b>

14:58.350 --> 14:59.640
<b>Blade...</b>

14:59.640 --> 15:01.900
<b>I've been waiting for you.</b>

15:02.310 --> 15:03.770
<b>Where's your boss?</b>

15:03.770 --> 15:06.070
<b>I don't need him to handle you.</b>

15:06.280 --> 15:10.360
<b>Besides, why should I tell you where
he is, when you're about to die?</b>

15:10.910 --> 15:11.910
<b>I see.</b>

15:11.910 --> 15:12.620
<b>Very well.</b>

15:52.030 --> 15:56.970
THE FIRST
BLADE

15:52.850 --> 15:56.970
SAVAGE
MOON

16:14.210 --> 16:16.370
<b>That should do it for tonight.</b>

16:17.220 --> 16:18.470
<b>Stay on your toes.</b>

16:44.830 --> 16:46.100
<b>That's...</b>

16:47.340 --> 16:49.150
<b>Existence's boss!</b>

16:54.970 --> 16:56.970
<b>Makoto, listen closely.</b>

16:58.050 --> 17:00.520
<b>If you want to make it
as a 1st rate hunter,</b>

17:00.520 --> 17:02.480
<b>you must put your
feelings aside, got it?</b>

17:03.480 --> 17:05.440
<b>What are you saying?</b>

17:05.440 --> 17:06.810
<b>Do you understand?</b>

17:06.810 --> 17:08.060
<b>Y-Yes.</b>

17:13.700 --> 17:14.700
<b>Run for it!</b>

17:28.030 --> 17:29.220
<b>Dad!</b>

17:36.220 --> 17:42.970
<b>Don't!</b>

17:58.040 --> 17:59.100
<b>Dad!</b>

18:12.470 --> 18:13.340
<b>Hold it!</b>

18:16.090 --> 18:17.260
<b>It's you...</b>

18:26.270 --> 18:28.520
<b>My name is Deacon Frost.</b>

18:29.520 --> 18:33.610
<b>Now, let that frenzied fear
take hold of your blood.</b>

18:35.740 --> 18:37.820
<b>The same way your mother did.</b>

18:38.400 --> 18:39.700
<b>Shut your mouth!</b>

18:58.380 --> 19:00.050
<b>We'll meet again.</b>

19:00.050 --> 19:01.320
<b>S... </b>

19:01.320 --> 19:02.860
<b>Stop... </b>

19:13.700 --> 19:17.590
<b>We've retrieved a sample of
the Daywalker's blood.</b>

19:19.360 --> 19:20.280
<b>Let's go.</b>

19:25.030 --> 19:26.540
<b>Dad...</b>

19:26.540 --> 19:28.330
<b>what are you doing?</b>

19:28.330 --> 19:30.960
<b>I'm begging you,
open your eyes!</b>

19:31.790 --> 19:33.040
<b>Dad!</b>

19:42.010 --> 19:43.030
<b>Dad!</b>

19:43.470 --> 19:44.680
<b>Dad, are you OK...</b>

20:20.970 --> 20:22.300
<b>Father...</b>

20:56.960 --> 20:58.090
<b>You son of a bitch!</b>

21:00.540 --> 21:02.740
<b>You killed my father!</b>

21:15.310 --> 21:16.770
<b>Dammit.</b>

21:21.440 --> 21:25.070
<b>God dammit!</b>

23:02.540 --> 23:06.380
<b>This string of disappearances
isn't letting up, is it?</b>

23:06.380 --> 23:07.840
<b>That's true.</b>

23:07.840 --> 23:10.590
<b>They've even increased,
in the last few months.</b>

23:11.640 --> 23:15.350
<b>No matter where I go,
there's always people like this.</b>

23:15.350 --> 23:17.180
<b>Getting intel isn't exactly easy.</b>

23:18.430 --> 23:20.270
<b>I've been expecting you.</b>

23:20.270 --> 23:22.670
<b>Allow me to formally introduce myself...</b>

23:22.980 --> 23:24.040
<b>Hang in there,</b>

23:24.040 --> 23:25.130
<b>I'm coming to save you!</b>

23:25.610 --> 23:30.990
<i><b>Mad World</b></i>

23:26.030 --> 23:29.780
<b>Next time on Blade: Mad World.</b>
